Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.17,0:01:54.01,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(650,0)\blur0.8\bord0\c&HE7E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Klabautermann
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.94,0:01:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire! Emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody wake up! Damn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pirates started this, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to do something quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still a lot of people left inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg might be trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make sure he made it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put out that fire! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.94,0:02:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears the fire is\Nbeginning to spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leopard, human, whatever the hell you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not going to lay one\Nfinger on Iceberg, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's a carnivore Snow type.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the most brutal of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.86,0:02:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.77,0:02:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Logia-types,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoan-types, Paramethia-types, each one\Nextremely powerful in their own unique way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ability to enhance\None's own personal strength
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happens to be the\Nspecialty of the Zoan-type.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, the more we\Ntrain, the stronger we get.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.06,0:03:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which makes the Zoan-type the most lethal\Nwhen it comes to attacks at close range.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg! Go! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luchi, the workmen are making their\Nway up the stairs. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll never make it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ceiling's collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, Dada!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.02,0:03:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I'm\Ngetting you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way your wounds are far too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we can't let you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm afraid, you're gonna have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to be you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you are mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talking pigeon jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finger pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.74,0:05:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a nice flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kalifa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iron body!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.52,0:06:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did everyone make it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's taken the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.82,0:06:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't go back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.42,0:06:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have each team check to\Nsee if anyone's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you heard\Nanything about Iceberg?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.56,0:06:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not stuck in there, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.14,0:06:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The foremen are with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way they left him behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Search the area!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's here somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman's one of the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:06:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she jump out from one of the windows?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She probably got trapped by the fire and\Ndidn't have any other choice in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what should we do with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These damn pirates have\Ndone a terrible thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.98,0:07:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make her tell us where\Nthe rest of her crew is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll hunt them down and\Nturn them over to the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The testimony of a pirate\Nwon't hold up as evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.04,0:07:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This case will remain a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg, no matter how great of\Na shipbuilding engineer you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter how great a mayor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a mere individual citizen shouldn't\Noppose the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.66,0:07:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go we need to find tom's\Nother apprentice Franky or
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rather cutty flab and take\Nthose blueprints away from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granny! Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a huge fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Galilaw's main office.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.98,0:08:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a terrible thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.78,0:08:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did someone start the fire on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.56,0:08:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't really say for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But usually, when I get a bad\Nfeeling, it turns out to be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure hope that Iceberg is doing okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.68,0:08:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, all this is happening over\Nthat thing, it shouldn't even exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:09:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sure of it? You saw Franky\Nwandering into your bar earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I spoke with him, but he\Ntook off to go look for Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.36,0:09:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like he doesn't stay\Nin one place for very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.63,0:09:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some people just have the\Nworst sense of timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.64,0:09:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.86,0:09:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got Long Nose! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We totally have him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want him to sing\Nin the key of C! You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you it's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you don't want him\Nto sink into the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Break some iced tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.02,0:09:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea! Are you deaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of threat is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.76,0:09:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.01,0:09:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that matters is getting\Nthe message to Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving him that stupid\Nmessage won't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.32,0:09:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, bro, Franky will\Nend up kicking your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want him sunk\Nto the bottom of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go to the warehouse under the\Nbridge with the guards, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he gets the message and he does come,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bro's gonna beat the\Nliving crap out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did you say is waiting for whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where is this certain someone waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're kind of busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to live, you'll answer my\Nquestion in the next three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.48,0:10:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that some kind of joke, you nutjob?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even have the slightest clue\Nas to what family we're a part of?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you mean by the\Nwarehouse under the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.28,0:10:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the place where Franky is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.76,0:10:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever business you have with Franky?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna have to go through\Nus first, right, guys?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.58,0:10:43.50,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(394,0)\blur0.6\fscx160\fscy160\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(349,394,\1a&H00&)}Main Bridge Opposite the Garbage Dump\NNortheast Shore, the Narrows, Water Seven
Dialogue: 2,0:10:40.58,0:10:43.50,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(394,0)\blur0.6\bord0\fscx160\fscy160\4a&HFF&}Main Bridge Opposite the Garbage Dump\NNortheast Shore, the Narrows, Water Seven
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.54,0:10:45.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(437,0)\blur0.6\fscx160\fscy160\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(392,437,\1a&H00&)}A Warehouse Under the Bridge\N(Franky's Secret Base)
Dialogue: 2,0:10:43.54,0:10:45.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fad(437,0)\an8\fscx160\fscy160\4a&HFF&}A Warehouse Under the Bridge\N(Franky's Secret Base)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.64,0:11:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why in the world are the three\Nof you crying about it? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not crying, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking\Nabout everything you've
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been through to protect\Nthat ship all alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it touched my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of us are crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is wrong with these nitwits?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you get the gist of it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're no longer friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are part of my past now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sad that I'll have to sing about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This song is called Severed\NFriendship, North Wind Child!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Sing it, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you making fun of me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the tea ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dying of thirst over here. Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll bring it over in just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.93,0:11:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That crying wore me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I really cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now be careful, it's really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.40,0:12:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I understand what's what, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.28,0:12:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She just got through telling you that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.22,0:12:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.78,0:12:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, bro. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a break\Nand have some tea as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.78,0:12:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be holding quite\Nthe grudge against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, since we stole your\N200 million berries and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially because it led to such\Na big fight with your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens, happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.54,0:12:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sense holding a grudge about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.26,0:12:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking the high road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About that money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spent all of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.34,0:12:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna knock you flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:13:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, don't get so worked up,\Nespecially after you showed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.68,0:13:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how dignified and forgiving you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we just let bygones\Nbe bygones? I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.22,0:13:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't flipped out on you for destroying\Nmy home and demolition factory, have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And on top of that, you guys\Nannihilated my subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastards, how dare you all kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, bro, you gotta control that anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arrgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.67,0:13:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a lot has happened these past few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I do think we're better\Noff putting it all behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you say we just put the\Naxe in the ground and call it a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.52,0:13:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you mean bury the hatchet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm pretty sure it's\Nbury the hatchet, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will you do now\Nthat you're on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.84,0:13:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like\Nyou have anywhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.28,0:13:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell you what why don't\Nyou let me take care of you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:14:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,join the Franky family\NYou seem like a good man,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I can always get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no plans to\Nbecome a ship dismantler
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm no longer a Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am still a pirate got it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've moved me to song.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the pirate code
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.46,0:14:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sing it. I still think\Nyou're making fun of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm just concerned, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.18,0:14:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My future is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are other things you should\Nbe concerned with right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like that huge storm headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True, but we're safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna can be pretty devastating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it hits, we all\Nhave to pull together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting now until late into the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,houses will be submerged\Nup to the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.50,0:14:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're stuck in the back\Nstreets or capes during that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance,\Nbut this area is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.98,0:14:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ship will be safe, too,\Nif you want to keep it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:14:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.18,0:15:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like we're strangers, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I imagine it must be\Ntough having to deal with
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.24,0:15:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this storm and the chaos\Nit causes every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.62,0:15:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've all gotten used to\Nthe annual evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real problem is the water level.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It increases little by\Nlittle every single year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The back streets you see all\Nthrough Water 7 are built on the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.70,0:15:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rooftops of an old town that\Nexisted several hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's said that the shipbuilding\Nisland and the back
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,streets used to be part\Nof the same piece of land.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, so much of it\Nhas sunk under the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why they call it a floating city.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the sidewalks became\Ncanals and waterways.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to be more precise about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,technically, rather than saying\Nthe water level is increasing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the foundation of the\Nisland is actually sinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it keeps up, the city will\Nbecome harder and harder to live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.62,0:15:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.53,0:15:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even this beautiful city of water has\Nits share of hardships, too, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if push comes to shove,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.38,0:16:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can just take the Sea Train\Nand go live somewhere else, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can say that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not always.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only been around for ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before that time, you\Nwere totally out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting across the ocean without it's\Nno easy task, even if you have a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island is isolated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was never much\Ntraffic to or from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people who lived here carried\Nwith them the looming fear that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.06,0:16:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someday this entire city and everything\Naround it would sink into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They became hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one thing that finally\Ntook away that fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.24,0:16:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was the Sea Train the\Npuffing tom now anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at any time can travel\Nacross the sea without
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.68,0:16:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a Log Pose this was a\Nhuge step for the island
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we owe everything to one man,\Na brilliant shipwright named Tom,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:16:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who created that C-train.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saved us all, and he\Ngave this island new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.90,0:17:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say hello to your bro for\Nyou when we pay him a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We now know the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.58,0:18:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, got a question for you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just get right to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do\Nafter you fix that ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.06,0:18:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we'll go on a\Nfew adventures together,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and eventually I'll sail her back\Nto our home in the East Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we didn't sail around\Nthe world or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.46,0:18:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the Mary and I made it\Nall the way to the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd call that a successful voyage that\Nwill end with a triumphant return!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So with our heads held high...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.87,0:18:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go all the way\Nback to the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.84,0:18:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.74,0:18:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took a close look at your ship when\Nwe were bringing it up here earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got to see her from every angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ship is at the end of her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Galilaw's assessment was correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As an expert in the demolition\Nbusiness, I suggest you dismantle her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.97,0:19:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.06,0:19:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even help you do the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.16,0:19:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I'm an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell are you\Ntalking about, you jerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.76,0:19:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm simply offering to help\Ndemolish this ship, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.74,0:19:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop screwing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you\Nanywhere near her, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.68,0:19:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Mary is my ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.56,0:19:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old girl's no longer a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you say? Earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.02,0:19:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked you a question about what you\Nplanned on doing once you fixed that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.67,0:19:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you had said that you\Nwere going to cast away
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.24,0:19:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your life to the sea and\Ngo down along with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.69,0:19:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, I wouldn't have had\Nanything to say about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:19:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.10,0:20:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.01,0:20:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since you just told me\Nthat you plan on going
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the way back to\Nthe East Blue with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, now I have to stop you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ship is at her end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She won't even make it to the next island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, a ship is born with one promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to carry you across the sea\Nfrom one shore to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's her sole purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.00,0:20:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason for her existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when the time comes that a ship can\Nno longer carry you across the sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that promise has been broken,\Nand she's no longer a ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.16,0:20:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.76,0:21:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep away from the Mary's!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.46,0:21:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.32,0:21:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.78,0:21:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, take a look with your own damn eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SIGHS
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.76,0:22:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.00,0:23:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.38,0:23:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.26,0:24:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.42,0:24:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.78,0:24:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fix you up right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.22,0:24:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.72,0:24:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As many times as you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.94,0:24:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.96,0:24:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.04,0:24:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.22,0:24:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, enough already, Long Nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.92,0:24:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw the bottom of the ship, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.96,0:24:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The keel is broken right down the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.16,0:24:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The outer panels are slipping\Noff and the frame is shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.04,0:25:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a hull like that, the\Nfirst wave would rip her apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.38,0:25:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you think that a complete amateur\Nlike you can just grab a hammer and...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.48,0:25:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shut your damn mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.46,0:25:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear\Nanother word out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.46,0:25:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you so much as breathe, I'll\Nkick your teeth and you'll hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.12,0:25:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beside.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.74,0:25:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.20,0:25:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.46,0:25:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my heart, I knew it all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.18,0:25:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.10,0:26:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that the Mary was\Nat the end of our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.52,0:26:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deep down, I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.26,0:26:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I heard the assessment,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.48,0:26:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that what I saw on that day\Nback in Skypiea really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.10,0:26:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought I was dreaming\Nthat there was no way it could be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.04,0:26:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On one foggy night,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.68,0:26:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a forest lit with\Nnothing but moonlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.38,0:26:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the hammering\Nstrikes of a wooden mallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.98,0:26:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounded like it was coming from the\Ndirection of the ship, but at the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.48,0:26:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there shouldn't have\Nbeen anybody on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.32,0:26:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I crept closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.84,0:26:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It confirmed the sound was\Nindeed coming from the Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.90,0:26:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fog was thick, but I'm\Nsure I saw someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.60,0:26:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,striking away with a wooden mallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.30,0:27:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't figure out who it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.66,0:27:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.36,0:27:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the morning of the next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.80,0:27:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We awoke to find that the ship\Nhad been haphazardly repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.24,0:27:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the broken mast was back\Nwhere it had always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.86,0:27:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there was something even more\Npeculiar that was bugging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.04,0:27:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever fixed the Mary\Nknew how she used to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.34,0:27:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite all the\Nmodifications we made to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.00,0:27:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this mysterious person had brought\Nher back to her original shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.76,0:27:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was still in rough condition, but she\Nwas the same old Mary she had been before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.74,0:27:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole situation remained a mystery,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.62,0:27:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but for some reason these\Nwords lingered in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.06,0:27:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's something\NI actually heard someone say,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.92,0:27:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or maybe just something I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.10,0:27:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.28,0:27:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll carry everyone for\Na little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.38,0:28:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it sounds ridiculous, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.20,0:28:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it was the\Nincarnation of the Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.98,0:28:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she spoke to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.54,0:28:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She probably already knew\Nthat she was at her limits,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.64,0:28:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so she appeared in\Nthat form to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.34,0:28:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wanted to reassure us\Nthat it'd be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.36,0:28:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought of when I\Nheard her assessment from Galley-La.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.90,0:28:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm completely\Nout of my mind, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.78,0:28:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care, you don't\Nhave to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.08,0:28:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.32,0:28:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether I believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.66,0:28:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you said that whoever it was you saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.10,0:28:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looked like someone holding\Na wooden mallet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.86,0:28:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.04,0:28:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it mean something?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.82,0:28:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.64,0:28:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means that you saw a Klebautermon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.80,0:29:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kle-Kleba-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.46,0:29:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Klebautermon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.18,0:29:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an old legend that's passed\Ndown from sailor to sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.70,0:29:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a very particular type of ferry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.00,0:29:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only dwells on ships\Ntreated with great care.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.24,0:29:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could say it's the ship's spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.26,0:29:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's said that it carries a wooden hammer\Nin its hand and wears a sailor's raincoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.72,0:29:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At times when the vessel is in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.10,0:29:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll run around the ship and\Nfind some way to warn everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.28,0:29:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that they help\Nsailors in other ways, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.32,0:29:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.08,0:29:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is the first time I've ever heard\Nsomeone say outright that they've seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.48,0:29:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more care a ship receives, the more\Nthey grow to appreciate the sailors.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.84,0:29:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship must have been determined to\Nmake sure you made it to the next shore,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.70,0:29:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.34,0:29:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.96,0:29:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship had a caring crew\Nthat was so special to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.28,0:29:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she even appeared in\Nhuman form to reassure
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.82,0:29:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them that everything\Nwas going to be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.42,0:30:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you she's been very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.66,0:30:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.54,0:30:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.58,0:30:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.06,0:30:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were the one who made those repairs\Nand spoke to me back then, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.28,0:30:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.32,0:30:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As amazing as that is, I'm still confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.30,0:30:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.42,0:30:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why would you have a big fight with your\Ncrew when you knew the ship was done for?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.50,0:30:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.30,0:30:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never understand\Nwhy men are so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.04,0:30:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.28,0:31:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like someone's at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.36,0:31:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone who else would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.10,0:31:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But zombie and the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.60,0:31:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would they take the long way\Nand come in from the seaside?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.12,0:31:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.32,0:31:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They normally come in\Nthrough the upper entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.22,0:31:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they had to because they\Nwere able to capture Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.08,0:31:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.40,0:31:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kidnapped you to use your\Nbait to lure out your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.14,0:31:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't come!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.54,0:31:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer part of that crew, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.20,0:31:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That plan won't work
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.24,0:31:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they ringing the bell\Nwhen they can just come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.14,0:31:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How annoying?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.12,0:31:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, hold on, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.96,0:31:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough already, we hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.90,0:31:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.66,0:32:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, brother, listen, I think what\Nyou should do is go back to your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.52,0:32:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to do that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.26,0:32:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I challenge the captain\Nto a duel for starters!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.62,0:32:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then there's the matter of the\Nship that hasn't been settled yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.44,0:32:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean hasn't been settled?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.64,0:32:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your ship can't sail anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.54,0:32:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it can't sail anymore\NThat's the end of it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.78,0:32:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave her here with me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of her in a\Nway that you'd approve of.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.46,0:32:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.56,0:32:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't thinking about\Nwhat I was doing earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.94,0:32:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to dismantle the ship without\Nconsidering what would be best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.12,0:32:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be different this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.26,0:32:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.42,0:32:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.88,0:32:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm just trying to help\Nyou - Is that you, zombie?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.44,0:32:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some gratitude, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.66,0:32:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gratitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.57,0:32:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.66,0:32:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.46,0:32:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As hard as it is for you,\Nit's worse on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.38,0:32:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She loves you guys so much that\Nshe appeared to you in human form.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.10,0:32:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she sinks to the bottom of the\Nsea while you're still on board,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.96,0:33:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then all of that will\Nhave been for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.06,0:33:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.97,0:33:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that happens, her final moments\Nwill be filled with regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.92,0:33:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She won't be able to die in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.66,0:33:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you'd do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.84,0:33:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After everything you'd\Nbeen through together,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.42,0:33:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd leave one of your friends\Nbehind to die on their own?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.06,0:33:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just throw them aside like trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.24,0:33:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the same thing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.22,0:33:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.64,0:33:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the same thing, and\Nthat's exactly what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.22,0:33:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, you just don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.64,0:33:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mozu!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.56,0:33:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kiwi!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.50,0:33:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for the interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.24,0:33:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just, those two ladies weren't being\Nvery accommodating about letting us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.12,0:33:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you\Nbastards doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.28,0:33:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iron body.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.50,0:33:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.22,0:34:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What gives, Belt?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.94,0:34:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got some kind of problem with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.30,0:34:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're trying to pull a reverse move, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.94,0:34:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dumbass, you should\Nknow better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.64,0:34:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one pushes me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.26,0:34:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be pouring\Nme a drink, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.50,0:34:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, you forget you're just a bartender?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.02,0:34:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's up with that outfit anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.32,0:34:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.02,0:34:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.32,0:34:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.78,0:34:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing him now would put\Nour mission in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.28,0:34:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.92,0:34:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.12,0:34:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what did you do to piss\Noff these shipyard guys so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.64,0:34:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The freak with the bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.94,0:34:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he get a hit like that on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.80,0:34:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.71,0:35:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you guys coming\Nin on my turf with a chip
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.82,0:35:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on your shoulders acting\Nlike you own the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.08,0:35:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And hitting girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.30,0:35:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so not cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.80,0:35:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kiwi and Mozu were like my little sisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.40,0:35:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, how'd you freaks\Neven find us here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.62,0:35:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my ultra top secret base!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.00,0:35:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How we found you is irrelevant,\Nas we are here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.98,0:35:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But know this we came to this town\Nassigned to a covert operation
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.82,0:35:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with special agents spies\Nworking for the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.62,0:35:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Assume even you would know why\Nwe came here and what we're after?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.98,0:35:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky we know the secret\Nthat you're keeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.74,0:35:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.58,0:35:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rumor was that Tom's apprentice\Nperished about eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.30,0:35:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.14,0:35:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's some pretty amazing detective work.\NI'm real impressed, but I'm starting to
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.24,0:35:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get a sour feeling down in my gut where
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.80,0:35:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is he where the hell is iceberg he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.10,0:36:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late to feign innocence.\NWe already know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.82,0:36:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore the government targets me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.86,0:36:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to take these and\Nleave this island, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.00,0:36:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tom entrusted them to Iceberg,\Nand Iceberg entrusted them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.54,0:36:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boys, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.50,0:36:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time I let you\Nin on something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.44,0:36:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long game,\Nbut now we're checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.42,0:36:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I know you have the\Nplans for the ancient weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.06,0:36:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand over Pluton's blueprints, Kaido Flam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.06,0:36:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flam, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.22,0:36:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's kind of a funny name.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.86,0:36:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we just call you Franky instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.60,0:36:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.92,0:36:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.32,0:36:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand them over this instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.26,0:36:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, did you just say hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.86,0:37:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did he just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.28,0:37:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so fast I couldn't see\Nwhat happened. Hey! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.78,0:37:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.60,0:37:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You found a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.64,0:37:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you suppose is this\Nfilthy place's purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.02,0:37:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are drafting tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.80,0:37:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, where blueprints are\Nmade, and perhaps hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.00,0:37:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.12,0:37:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look here, nameplates, Kaido Flam,\NIceberg, Tom, the Shipwright.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.46,0:37:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.34,0:37:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your paws off of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.56,0:38:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're poking your noses into\Nmy personal space, my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.96,0:38:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the place where I grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.00,0:38:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What used to house the shipbuilding\Ncompany, Tom's Workers?

